  "Id": 2159,
  "Title": "Strategic Review of Food Security and Nutrition in Pakistan Report",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Access to safe and nutritious food is implicitly recognized as a basic right by the Islamic Republic of Pakistan under its Constitution, and by the current Federal Government administration, which is committed to ensure a food-secure and well-nourish",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Access to safe and nutritious food is implicitly recognized as a basic right by the Islamic Republic of"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pakistan under its Constitution, and by the current Federal Government administration, which is"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "committed to ensure a food-secure and well-nourished population in its Vision 2025 document. This"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Strategic Review for Food Security and Nutrition in Pakistan aims to identify key challenges and"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "prioritized areas for strategic action by the Government of Pakistan (GoP), supported by humanitarian,"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "development, private sector and civil society partners. The Review was carried out by the International"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI) and Aga Khan University (AKU) under the direction of the GoP's"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Economic Affairs Division (EAD) and guided by an Advisory Group co-chaired by the EAD Secretary and"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the Resident Coordinator of the United Nations in Pakistan. The remainder of this introduction delves"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "into the important challenges and possibilities for food security and nutrition. The second part presents"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "immediate and longer run actions that can be taken by government and all development partners to"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "improve outcomes. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Click here to view report.",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/news/Documents/A Strategic Review of Pakistan Nutrition Food Insecurity Report.pdf",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
